<title>USA: Borg-Warner Security Corp Q4 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Borg-Warner Security Corp Q4 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.26		    $0.18</p>
<p> Oper net		   6,200		    4,100</p>
<p> Revs		     443,900		  429,300</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 results exclude loss from discontinued operations of $1.3 million or $0.06/shr and loss from early extinguishment of debt of $4.7 million or $0.20/shr.  </p>
<p>		  YEAR</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.59		   $ 0.36</p>
<p> Oper net		  13,900		    8,400</p>
<p> Revs		   1,711,200		1,708,500</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year operating results exclude losses from discontinued operations of $28.5 million or $1.21/shr in 1996 vs loss of $2.5 million or $0.11/shr in 1995.</p>
<p>1995 full-year results exclude loss of $4.7 million or $0.20/shr from early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
